SyncVersionedReadTransactionLazyMixin: Lazy stubs for versioned read methods
(row, select_at_revision, get_history, graph, diff_bytes, etc.).

SyncVersionedWriteTransactionLazyMixin: All versioned write methods are pure — no I/O.
